1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,230
This is a factory of the future. An order comes in, and the whole plant starts moving on its own.
这是一座未来工厂。订单一进来，整座工厂就自己动起来。

2
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:12,350
Materials leave the automated warehouse, every tote scanned by barcode and QR code, and driverless carts carry them to the line.
原料从立体仓库出库，每一箱都扫条码、扫二维码，无人车一路送到产线。

3
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:16,320
Robot arms take over: loading, fastening, assembling, one after another.
机械臂接手：上料、拧紧、装配，一台接一台。

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:21,310
Every product passes a machine-vision station: image, measure, decide, in the blink of an eye.
每一件产品都要经过机器视觉质检站：拍照、测量、判定，一眨眼完成。

5
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:31,300
Rejects are pushed off the line; good parts get an automatically generated FDA UDI label, a 2D code plus human-readable text, then a verifying scan, and they ship.
不合格的，自动推出产线；合格的，自动生成 FDA 要求的 UDI 标签：二维码加人能读的文字，贴上、扫码复核、发货。

6
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:34,850
Data from every machine flows, live, into one data hub.
所有设备的数据，都实时汇到同一个数据中枢。

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:39,650
Zoom in on the inspection station. Camera above, ring light on, parts flowing underneath.
放大看质检站。相机在上，环形灯打光，零件从下面流过。

8
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:48,400
It first reads the 2D code on the part to know its lot, then turns the image into dimensions: hole size, spacing, scratches, each checked against the drawing.
系统先读零件上的二维码，知道它是哪一批；再把图像变成尺寸：孔径、孔距、划痕，一项项和图纸公差比。

9
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:53,220
All in tolerance: green light, pass. One out: a pusher sends it into the quarantine bin.
全部合格，亮绿灯放行；有一项超差，推杆把它推进隔离箱。

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,540
Every reading goes onto a control chart. When the trend drifts, it alarms before a single bad part.
每个测量值都画进控制图。趋势一偏，还没出废品，就先报警。

11
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:04,080
AI drafts the nonconformance report, but the disposition takes effect only when an engineer approves.
AI 起草不合格报告，但怎么处置，要工程师点头才生效。

12
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:20,080
The inspection station is more than a camera. A coordinate measuring machine; a 3D scanner on five axes, X, Y and Z plus a tilting head and a rotary table, moving together to cover the whole part; and a roughness tester. Their results come back automatically. No copying by hand.
质检站不只有相机。三坐标测量机；三维扫描仪装在五轴上：X、Y、Z 三个直线轴，加上扫描头摆动和转台旋转，联动扫完整个零件；还有粗糙度仪。测完的数据自动传回，不用抄。

13
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:27,460
Calipers, micrometers and custom gauges send wirelessly: one press, and the reading lands in the record, tied to the part and the feature.
游标卡尺、千分尺、专用量规，带无线发送：按一下，读数就进记录，对上是哪个零件、哪一项。

14
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:35,630
Every reading records which gauge took it. If that gauge is past its calibration date, the reading is refused and the gauge is flagged for recalibration.
每个读数都记着用的是哪台量具。量具过了校准期，读数不收，提醒送检。

15
00:01:35,630 --> 00:01:41,970
All readings come together in one table, judged automatically, plotted on control charts, and sent on to the data hub.
所有读数汇成一张表，自动判合格，进控制图，再进数据中枢。

16
00:01:41,970 --> 00:01:47,070
Finally, the hub: orders, inventory, machines and quality, in one connected web of data.
最后看中枢：订单、库存、设备、质量，连成一张数据网。

17
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:52,050
A digital twin draws the whole plant live on screen: where it's slow, where it's jammed, at a glance.
数字孪生把整座工厂实时画在屏幕上，哪里慢、哪里堵，一眼看到。

18
00:01:52,050 --> 00:01:56,120
When something's off, AI suggests a fix: change the tool, slow down, restock.
发现问题，AI 给出建议：换刀、降速、补料。

19
00:01:56,120 --> 00:02:01,830
A person approves at the key step, robots carry it out, and the results flow back to the hub. A closed loop.
人在关键处确认，机器人执行，结果再回到中枢，形成闭环。

20
00:02:01,830 --> 00:02:07,600
Fully integrated, fully automated. People are freed from hauling and watching, to focus on judgment.
全集成，全自动。人从搬运和盯守里解放出来，专心做判断。

